# .copilotignore
#
# TOKEN COST: Each excluded file reduces context size on EVERY Copilot request.
# Files listed here are completely removed from Copilot's context.
# Review quarterly and add your project's generated/build files.
#
# Impact: a well-configured .copilotignore can cut context by 30-60%
# for repos with significant build artifacts or generated code.
#
# Format: same as .gitignore

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
vendor/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.bundle/
Pods/

# ── Lock files (high token count, zero AI value) ──────────────────────────────
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
Gemfile.lock
poetry.lock
Cargo.lock
go.sum
composer.lock

# ── Build outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
.output/
target/
bin/
obj/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe

# ── Generated files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.generated.ts
*.generated.js
*.pb.go
*.pb.ts
generated/
auto-generated/
__generated__/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.bundle.js
*.chunk.js

# ── Coverage and test artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ── IDE and tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/extensions.json

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Media and assets (not useful as code context) ─────────────────────────────
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.ico
*.svg
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.eot
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.pdf

# ── Data files (often large, rarely useful context) ───────────────────────────
*.csv
*.tsv
*.json.bak
fixtures/
seeds/
migrations/*.sql

# ── Infrastructure as Code (state files) ──────────────────────────────────────
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
.terraform/
.terragrunt-cache/

# ── Secrets and environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.cert

# ── Docs that aren't useful as code context ───────────────────────────────────
# (Comment this out if you want Copilot to reference your docs)
# docs/

# ── Project-specific additions ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add your project's generated/build files below this line:
#
# [PLACEHOLDER — e.g. "src/generated/", "proto/", "storybook-static/"]
